# Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)

<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/>

The derived datasets in this directory are released under CC BY-NC 4.0 — free to
share and adapt with attribution to The Right to Read; commercial use requires a
separate agreement.

| File | Dataset |
|---|---|
| `data.js` | State library expenditure, historical timeline, legislation ledger |
| `constituencies.js` | Assembly constituencies by state |
| `local-body.js` | Ward and councillor data, derived from sevent4's public city layers |
| `publications.js` | Working-paper registry |

These are derived datasets. Cite the primary sources named on the site and in
the papers for the underlying facts, not this repository.

The JavaScript, CSS, and rendering code in this directory is MIT — see the
`LICENSE` at the repository root.
